<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "publish the Nexus floor release with the seats' approval"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.release.publishes", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.release.publishes"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.release.publishes"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.release.publishes ~ one porch body naming the released floor manifest

`lares nexus release <manifest-file> approval=<file> [nexus=<aid>]` seals the floor release as steward with the seats' approval of the manifest's exact bytes attached; it lands on the publication board once it counts, and a release that counts nothing lands nothing and says why. `--cut` cuts a release manifest instead (`--thin` names what it leaves out). A herm signs none.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ release · cut

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`release` params=`file/manifest.json approval/a.json ~ publish the floor release`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`cut` params=`file/manifest.json cut/true ~ cut a manifest`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file · approval · nexus · cut · thin

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<manifest-file> ~ the manifest`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`approval` params=`takes/host-path ~ the seats' approval file`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cut` params=`kind/switch ~ cut a release manifest`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`thin` params=`takes/list ~ beside cut=true, what the manifest leaves out`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ a seat held in this vault seals as steward`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.release.publishes file/manifest.json approval/a.json]] ~ no manifest, or no approval`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ released

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`released` params=`exit/0 ~ the release landed, or why it counts nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus release

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus release]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

